# ============================================
# VLO Feature Configuration
# ============================================
# Comma-separated list of features to enable
# Available: auth, database, api, modules, email, sse, files, flash, pagination, directives
# 
# Examples:
#   Full stack app:     VLO_FEATURES=auth,database,api,modules,email,sse,files,flash,pagination,directives
#   Simple blog:        VLO_FEATURES=database,api,flash,pagination
#   Static landing:     VLO_FEATURES=
#   Dashboard only:     VLO_FEATURES=auth,database,api,sse,flash

